  "scope": "Phase-two first batch: registered document file and history commands, application-owned workflows and results, replaceable file input view, menus and shortcuts. No additional SDK source changes.",
  "status": "First batch implemented and validated. Phase two remains in progress; completed_phase stays one.",
  "implemented": [
    "New/Open/Save/SaveAs/SaveVersion/Revert/Close, Import/Merge and variants, player export, quit, Undo/Redo/Purge use registered commands and shared admission.",
    "DocumentFiles and RuntimeOperation moved to application. DocumentFiles no longer takes EditorState or a caller-supplied document replacement closure.",
    "DocumentCommands owns file progression and input IDs. EditorApplication alone retains bounded command outcomes; RuntimeOperation owns exclusive native execution and scoped completion.",
    "Closed views cancel unstarted commands, while accepted native file work retains actual written paths/counts even after its receiver expires or an executor throws after publication.",
    "Default file dialogs use the public input projection and response command as a registered singleton overlay. Independently built example module replaces the same view; failed creation preserves the prior provider and configuration.",
    "Registered command menus and shortcut aliases preserve default labels/behavior and allow file/history reconfiguration. Old PendingAction and duplicate root file dispatch removed."
  ],
  "remaining_phase_two": [
    "Selection, object creation/deletion and their UI entry points.",
    "Object/NMS export and resource operations.",
    "Runtime control entry points.",
    "Webpage, multi-output and print operation ownership; rendering remains with their existing views.",
    "Document replacement quiesce/attachment failure combinations and the remaining phase-two gaps in coverage.json."
  ],
